import Prelude
/-!
# Notation

The canonical spellings that are not in `Prelude` yet. Today: list cons, `::`.

`Prelude` itself is owned by the notation workstream; this module is the seam so the
project assemblies can use the one spelling without a local `infix` each. When the
`::` infix lands in `Prelude`, delete this module and its imports.
-/

infixr:67 " :: " => List.cons
